From: Self <self@local>
Date: Thu, 13 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 0002] add luci-app-blueaudio: BlueALSA A2DP/HFP switch, theme compatible

Add luci-app-blueaudio for bluealsa profile switch (A2DP / HFP)
No custom css, use built-in bluetooth icon, compatible with Argon/Bootstrap.

---
 feeds/pon_userspace/luci-app-blueaudio/Makefile                                      | 16 +++++
 feeds/pon_userspace/luci-app-blueaudio/root/etc/config/blueaudio                     |  3 +
 feeds/pon_userspace/luci-app-blueaudio/root/etc/init.d/blueaudio                     | 41 +++++++++++
 feeds/pon_userspace/luci-app-blueaudio/root/usr/share/luci/controllers/blueaudio.lua | 12 ++++
 feeds/pon_userspace/luci-app-blueaudio/root/usr/share/luci/i18n/zh-cn/blueaudio.po   | 34 +++++++++
 feeds/pon_userspace/luci-app-blueaudio/root/usr/share/luci/models/cbi/blueaudio.lua   | 24 +++++++
 6 files changed, 130 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 feeds/pon_userspace/luci-app-blueaudio/Makefile
 create mode 100644 feeds/pon_userspace/luci-app-blueaudio/root/etc/config/blueaudio
 create mode 100755 feeds/pon_userspace/luci-app-blueaudio/root/etc/init.d/blueaudio
 create mode 100644 feeds/pon_userspace/luci-app-blueaudio/root/usr/share/luci/controllers/blueaudio.lua
